}

/// Stage 2.1: banners of the Mini App home screen (up to 5, Настройки → Главная → Баннеры).
/// kind: doctor = «Отбор врачом • 4,9 на Яндекс Маркете», delivery = the delivery offer (both drawn by the Mini App);
/// image = a picture uploaded in the admin panel (RU and/or UZ, 3:1, stored as WebP + JPEG).
